AttenGene retrieves and surfaces content from public knowledge bases.
Cite the underlying sources when publishing work that uses AttenGene:

  - ClinVar (NCBI):       https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/clinvar/
  - GeneReviews (UW):     https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK1116/
  - NephroGenetics:       see docs/architecture.md

These sources are not redistributed with AttenGene. Users fetch them
directly via the bundled indexing scripts.
